# Innovera Research — Web Frontend Build Spec (Project Mono v2)

## Overview

This project adds a browser-based frontend to the existing Innovera Research pipeline (Project Mono). The CLI tool (`run_research.py`) already works — it extracts context from venture documents, runs 13 evidence categories via GPT Researcher, and produces YAML + Markdown evidence packages. This build wraps that pipeline in a FastAPI backend with WebSocket progress streaming, and a React frontend for input, monitoring, and output viewing.

**Do not rewrite the existing pipeline.** The backend is an API layer on top of the existing `ContextExtractor`, `ResearchRunner`, and `PackageAssembler` classes. The frontend is a standalone React app served by the same FastAPI process.

