are showing openness to:

Technology co-development

Strategic investments

M&A

Monitoring these developments helps identify which value propositions are most scalable and defensible.

Hypothesis

The emerging BCI and medical device markets are currently being shaped primarily by technologically strong North American startups.

To accelerate early market entry, LGIT may improve its chances of success by pursuing strategic collaboration and investment with startups such as Echo.

